culator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids May to June came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 53% of normal in August to September and 43% in November to December. In 2026 so far, May to June came in at 217% on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, and grid 14567 got 55% of normal that year.</p>"}
